This photo shows a nearly empty meal: a bowl with a faint residue, a plate with an orange sauce smear (probably a curry or tomato-based sauce), and a glass with a small amount of liquid, likely water. Only the leftover residue counts as food.

The plate smear looks like about 10 g of sauce at roughly 1.5 kcal/g, so about 15 kcal. The bowl residue adds perhaps 2 g and a few kcal. Together that comes to about 12 g and 20 kcal.

